hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"388","Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Faris ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abdur Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Mamar ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apne wisal tak koi qazi muqarrar nahi farmaya aur na Hazrat Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ne aur na Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ne, magar ye ke unhon ne apni khilafat ke aakhir me ek shakhs se kaha: Mujhe logon ke baaz muamlat se kafayat karo."
"389","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ibn Saad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, mere walid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se isi mafhum ke sath, unhon ne kaha: Yahan tak ke un ki zindagi ke aakhir ke qareeb yani Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ke zamane me to unhon ne Namir ki behan ke bete Yazid se kaha: Mujhe logon ke baaz muamlat se kafayat karo, yani chhote muamlat se."
"390","Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Jafar ibn Hayyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs qaziyon me se kisi qazi ki taraf bulaya jaye aur woh hazir na ho to woh zalim hai."
"391","Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Muhammad ibn al-Mughira al-Makhzumi al-Madani ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Sulaiman ibn Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Urwa ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Abdul Aziz al-Umari se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hazrat Ali ibn Abi Talib Raziallahu anhu ko Yemen par amil muqarrar farmaya to Hazrat Ali Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Aap ne mujhe bulaya aur mujhe wasiyyat farmai, un se kehte hue: Kam rutbe wale ko sharif se pehle rakho, kamzor ko taqatwar se pehle rakho aur mardon ko aurton se pehle rakho."
"392","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Hammad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Dawud ibn Abi Hind se, unhon ne Shaabi se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) kisi muamle me faisla farmate phir us ke baad us ke khilaf Quran nazil hota to Aap pehli martaba jo faisla farma chuke hote use nafiz farmate aur aainda Quran ke laye hue hukm ke mutabiq faisla farmate."
"393","Hamein Hilal ibn Bishr ne bayan kiya, hamein Yahya ibn Muhammad ibn Qays ne bayan kiya: Maine Zayd ibn Aslam ko suna ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo shakhs kisi cheez par das saal tak qabiz rahe to woh usi ki hai."
